Data

This repository contains no GeoNames data. The scripts under scripts/
download it from https://download.geonames.org/export/dump/ on demand.
GeoNames data is licensed under the Creative Commons Attribution 4.0
License (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/). A deployment that
serves it must credit GeoNames (https://www.geonames.org/).

